commit 7e50a63de80e5e8808f22608b01b4bab8b2942d0
Author: HalcyonOmega <nathanbrown@me.com>
Date:   Thu Aug 20 01:50:56 2026 -0400

    wip: luna binpat matcher unification (partial, timed out) plus the cancelled-sleep fix
    
    Two lanes in one commit because they overlap in eval/exprs.rs.
    
    COMPLETE: the interpreter ran a settle path on group cancellation that native did
    not, and printed it BEFORE the cancel was observed. Native is correct per
    D-CANCELMODEL1=C - a cancelled wait unwinds and the post-wait child body cannot
    run. Root cause was one missing post-wait cancel check in the interpreter's sleep
    wait, so the shared wait policy is now consulted there like everywhere else.
    
    PARTIAL: the binary-pattern unification (#2100) hit its wall-clock limit mid-move,
    with a new Prelude home under jet-foundation, kernel widening, and tier-agreement
    tests started. Committed as a checkpoint so the work is not lost; verified next.

